1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:40,580
=Episode 10=

5
00:01:47,439 --> 00:01:48,560
Which of you

6
00:01:48,879 --> 00:01:51,040
is the Qin Demon of Mount Pingfeng?

7
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:58,879
Everyone who comes
asks the same question.

8
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:02,200
I am the Qin, and he is the Demon.

9
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,719
The same goes

10
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:04,760
the other way around.

11
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,280
We live on Mount Pingfeng.

12
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:10,199
Let's cut to the chase.

13
00:02:11,199 --> 00:02:13,000
How much gold will it take

14
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,879
to hire you two?

15
00:02:17,759 --> 00:02:19,840
You need to apologize first.

16
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:22,520
When you came in just now,
I asked you to wait,

17
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,159
but you walked
right into the inner room.

18
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:27,199
What if I were inside naked?

19
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:33,759
Just apologize.

20
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,039
It doesn't cost a thing.

21
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,400
My mistake.

22
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:48,719
Alright, you men go ahead and talk.

23
00:02:48,719 --> 00:02:49,960
I won't interrupt.

24
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:54,520
How much gold will it take

25
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:56,879
to hire you two?

26
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,080
How much do you have?

27
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:02,319
You're not asking what the job is?

28
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,360
However much gold you have,

29
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,560
that's how much work we do.

30
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:11,240
Our expenses are very high.
We can't help it.

31
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,439
Just this guqin alone

32
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:15,199
costs 50 taels of gold.

33
00:03:15,479 --> 00:03:19,159
And then there are rouge, perfume,
and hot spring baths daily...

34
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,120
One hundred taels

35
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:24,919
of gold.

36
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,719
Do you have it?

37
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,759
Is there any more?

38
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,800
One hundred taels is a lot.

39
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:51,479
Tie Futu,

40
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,439
where are those fierce men of yours

41
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:56,439
who usually follow you wherever you go?

42
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:59,800
I hear you came here alone.

43
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,120
Have you fallen so low?

44
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:03,479
What's wrong with me being alone?

45
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:05,759
What's wrong with being alone?

46
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,140
Yet you still came looking for us.

47
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:09,280
You should know that we are expensive.

48
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:12,080
Who is actually in charge?

49
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,439
Are 100 taels of gold still not enough?

50
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,439
It's more than enough.

51
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:23,800
Is your Soft Hedgehog Armor
made of gold?

52
00:04:24,199 --> 00:04:24,839
Yes.

53
00:04:25,279 --> 00:04:26,519
Can you give it to me?

54
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,600
I came to ask for your help.

55
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,319
It doesn't mean I'm afraid of you.

56
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,839
It's useless anyway.

57
00:04:36,032 --> 00:04:38,070
Two notes from my guqin
are worth more than it.

58
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:45,839
Pretend I was never here.

59
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:21,040
Asking you to hand over the armor

60
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,600
was such a hassle.

61
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,680
How can you take out this hundred taels

62
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:20,879
and then just take it back?

63
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,240
What sorcery

64
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,279
does this guqin have?

65
00:06:26,439 --> 00:06:30,279
It seems your internal power
is quite ordinary.

66
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:32,720
With our guqin music,

67
00:06:33,079 --> 00:06:35,399
the higher one's martial skill,
the harder it hits.

68
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,639
Ordinary people with no internal power

69
00:06:37,639 --> 00:06:39,160
aren't affected at all.

70
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:41,360
If we encounter ordinary people,

71
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,399
we can only reason with them nicely.

72
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,160
The better their martial arts,

73
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,439
the angrier we get instead.

74
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,759
Why don't you tell us
what this is about first?

75
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:54,600
Retrieve 300,000 taels of gold.

76
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:05,600
They say Gansu
has 300,000 taels of gold.

77
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:08,480
Do you know where they are hidden?

78
00:07:10,240 --> 00:07:11,160
Ganzhou,

79
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,839
under the Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission.

80
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,639
Where exactly?

81
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,759
Under the Regional
Military Commission Yamen.

82
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,920
Who told you?

83
00:07:25,639 --> 00:07:26,759
Zhang Luyao.

84
00:07:27,439 --> 00:07:28,639
A woman.

85
00:07:29,279 --> 00:07:31,120
I killed her entire family.

86
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:32,120
What was her name?

87
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:34,360
Zhang Luyao.

88
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,639
If I were her,

89
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:39,199
I would skin you alive

90
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,600
and drink your blood.

91
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,199
Tie Futu,

92
00:07:42,199 --> 00:07:44,040
have you lost your mind?

93
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,199
You haven't met Zhang Luyao.

94
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:48,199
She knows where the gold is.

95
00:07:48,199 --> 00:07:50,000
She wants you dead,

96
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:52,399
which is why she told you
that 300,000 taels of gold

97
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:54,530
is hidden in the Regional
Military Commission Yamen.

98
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,040
Don't laugh.

99
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:05,480
Thirty years ago,
when the gold was buried,

100
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:07,240
there was no Commander-in-Chief yet.

101
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,680
Tie Futu,

102
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:10,639
are you insane?

103
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:14,319
Someone finally told me
where the gold is.

104
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,040
I must...

105
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,820
How do we get into the Yamen?

106
00:08:16,839 --> 00:08:17,879
How do we get out?

107
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,639
And how do we get
the gold out of the underground?

108
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:23,000
That's why I'm asking you.

109
00:08:25,079 --> 00:08:28,160
I heard you were decisive and ruthless.

110
00:08:28,639 --> 00:08:30,240
I never expected you to be a lunatic.

111
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:32,600
Have you always been like this?

112
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:34,832
I've never been

113
00:08:34,848 --> 00:08:37,120
to the Regional
Military Commission Yamen before.

114
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,600
Right.

115
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:40,559
We have not been there.

116
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,799
For 100 taels of gold

117
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,399
plus a Soft Hedgehog Armor,

118
00:08:45,456 --> 00:08:48,096
Tie Futu asked us to go to
the Regional Military Commission Yamen

119
00:08:48,112 --> 00:08:49,440
to take a look around.

120
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,960
It's only fair that we go.

121
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,320
Even if it's fair, we shouldn't go.

122
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,480
He's crazy, but we aren't.

123
00:08:54,592 --> 00:08:55,630
Then, we'll have to return

124
00:08:55,664 --> 00:08:58,030
these 100 taels of gold and
the Soft Hedgehog Armor to him?

125
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:58,759
Return these...

126
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,879
You obviously don't want to.

127
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,919
If you don't want to,

128
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,360
neither do I.

129
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:11,320
How much gold can one horse carry?

130
00:09:14,304 --> 00:09:15,870
Three thousand two hundred taels.

131
00:09:16,208 --> 00:09:17,480
What about four thousand taels?

132
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:19,320
A fine horse could manage.

133
00:09:20,639 --> 00:09:23,639
Look, we ride two horses into
the Regional Military Commission Yamen,

134
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:24,464
and when we come out,

135
00:09:24,470 --> 00:09:25,680
four thousand taels per horse,

136
00:09:25,690 --> 00:09:27,312
and eight thousand taels for two horses.

137
00:09:27,344 --> 00:09:29,790
Wouldn't the Yamen become
a temple of the God of Wealth?

138
00:09:29,799 --> 00:09:32,679
And wouldn't the Commander-in-Chief
become the God of Wealth himself?

139
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:35,879
Sounds great.

140
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,279
Yan,

141
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:42,039
you've gone crazy, too.

142
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,799
Isn't my crazy side
what you like about me?

143
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,240
Deputy,

144
00:10:53,039 --> 00:10:54,200
may I ask...

145
00:10:54,879 --> 00:10:56,080
First, we go to Shiquan Fort.

146
00:10:57,399 --> 00:11:00,000
Shiquan Fort isn't part
of Liangzhou anymore.

147
00:11:00,799 --> 00:11:01,759
Further west,

148
00:11:02,128 --> 00:11:04,270
we go to Wusu Sea to find
the 300,000 taels of gold.

149
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,799
What happens after we find it?

150
00:11:06,279 --> 00:11:07,320
Everyone gets rich.

151
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,720
How are we supposed to get rich?

152
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,376
We won't be returning to Liangzhou?

153
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:13,639
You can turn back right now.

154
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:15,590
Once we find the gold,
why would we ever go back?

155
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,080
Deputy,

156
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,960
I still have a wife
and kid back in Liangzhou.

157
00:11:22,519 --> 00:11:23,799
Then go back

158
00:11:24,192 --> 00:11:25,390
and spend the rest of your life

159
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:27,000
eating yellow sand with them.

160
00:11:29,559 --> 00:11:30,960
Bana was my father.

161
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:33,399
When my father died,
he collapsed on top of you.

162
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:34,600
Shut up.

163
00:11:36,039 --> 00:11:37,879
I saw his lips moving.

164
00:11:38,159 --> 00:11:39,240
Weren't they moving?

165
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,559
I told you to shut up.

166
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:45,039
Did he say something to you?

167
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:47,559
Did he have a message
for you to pass to me?

168
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:50,639
My father surely
had something to tell me.

169
00:11:51,519 --> 00:11:53,080
If you say one more word,

170
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,736
I'll run you through with my spear.

171
00:11:57,279 --> 00:11:59,039
Does the General know

172
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,864
that we've been
following you all this way?

173
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,159
No, he doesn't.

174
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:05,320
So, we are

175
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,879
rebelling?

176
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,360
Have you lost your mind?

177
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,000
Coroner,

178
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,919
you can head back.

179
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:13,679
Say one more word,

180
00:12:13,679 --> 00:12:14,960
and you won't make it out alive.

181
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,159
Keep moving forward.

182
00:12:52,799 --> 00:12:53,639
You've come.

183
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,840
Bana's kid is here.

184
00:12:56,639 --> 00:12:58,039
Take us to Wusu Sea.

185
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:01,639
I've guarded
300,000 taels of gold for 30 years.

186
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:04,320
Taking you to get it
just for the sake of a boy?

187
00:13:04,679 --> 00:13:05,720
That's too easy.

188
00:13:06,336 --> 00:13:08,580
Someone is going to take
the gold sooner or later anyway.

189
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,440
True enough.

190
00:13:17,759 --> 00:13:19,399
If you can overcome my bow,

191
00:13:19,879 --> 00:13:21,759
then you're the ones
meant to take the gold.

192
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,679
If you can't,

193
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:25,480
I'll just bury you all

194
00:13:25,679 --> 00:13:27,080
and wait for the next group.

195
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,679
With just a single bow?

196
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:35,120
Let me show you what
the Liangzhou guards are capable of.

197
00:13:36,279 --> 00:13:37,000
Form up.

198
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,440
Divine machinery.

199
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,279
Quick.

200
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,600
Shield wall. Form a shield wall!

201
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:18,759
Take him down.

202
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,000
Interesting.

203
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,639
Let me show you what I've got.

204
00:15:30,399 --> 00:15:31,279
Don't move.

205
00:15:33,279 --> 00:15:34,200
Step back.

206
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,159
Seventeen,

207
00:15:44,639 --> 00:15:45,639
where's your father?

208
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:46,879
He's dead.

209
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:55,000
Who killed Bana?

210
00:15:55,759 --> 00:15:56,480
Me.

211
00:15:59,799 --> 00:16:00,440
I did.

212
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,240
I killed him.

213
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:02,000
So what?

214
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:06,039
That works out even better.

215
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,799
Saves us a lot of trouble.

216
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,639
The kid is still here.

217
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:12,360
I don't believe

218
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:14,600
you don't care about your guy's son.

219
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:15,879
Lad,

220
00:16:17,159 --> 00:16:19,320
Miss Zhang asked me
to pass a message to you.

221
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,480
What did she say?

222
00:16:22,919 --> 00:16:24,279
Pingping is dead.

223
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,519
Is there anything else?

224
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,720
Yes.

225
00:16:35,279 --> 00:16:36,600
You liar.

226
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,360
Your eyes are so bright

227
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:40,919
and so pure.

228
00:16:43,399 --> 00:16:44,360
Don't move.

229
00:16:44,559 --> 00:16:45,759
I will go find Luyao.

230
00:16:48,879 --> 00:16:50,279
I will go find Luyao.

231
00:16:54,559 --> 00:16:55,639
Among everyone here,

232
00:16:55,728 --> 00:16:57,150
you have the best martial skills.

233
00:16:57,639 --> 00:16:59,120
Did that official

234
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:01,440
tell you to keep an eye on Seventeen?

235
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,079
Yes.

236
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:06,119
So if I make a move against him,

237
00:17:06,119 --> 00:17:07,839
you'll kill Seventeen, right?

238
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:10,319
Yes!

239
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,440
Lad,

240
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:14,039
why?

241
00:17:14,039 --> 00:17:15,240
Why, my foot!

242
00:17:15,839 --> 00:17:17,359
My life belongs to the Deputy.

243
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:20,519
I kill whoever he tells me to kill.

244
00:17:22,519 --> 00:17:24,839
Miss Zhang asked me not to hurt you

245
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:26,680
and to spare your life.

246
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,799
I promised her,

247
00:17:28,599 --> 00:17:30,119
so I won't touch you,

248
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,920
and you don't touch Seventeen.

249
00:17:32,279 --> 00:17:33,799
But you're going after the Deputy.

250
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,039
Yes.

251
00:17:40,279 --> 00:17:41,720
If you dare touch the Deputy,

252
00:17:42,279 --> 00:17:43,279
I'll kill him!

253
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:46,799
Lad,

254
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:48,200
don't make this hard for me.

255
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:50,160
Don't you make this hard for me!

256
00:17:50,599 --> 00:17:52,039
Let's see if your spear is faster

257
00:17:52,319 --> 00:17:53,640
or my arrow is.

258
00:18:01,799 --> 00:18:02,680
Don't move.

259
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:07,720
Coroner,

260
00:18:08,279 --> 00:18:09,079
Fang,

261
00:18:10,839 --> 00:18:11,680
let's go back.

262
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:13,480
Go...

263
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:14,240
Go back.

264
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:14,880
Go.

265
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:16,039
Go back.

266
00:18:16,799 --> 00:18:18,119
The Deputy is right here.

267
00:18:18,359 --> 00:18:19,480
Where are you going back to?

268
00:18:19,599 --> 00:18:21,079
Brat, you are asking for death.

269
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:28,680
Deputy.

270
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,400
Deputy.

271
00:18:49,039 --> 00:18:49,799
Attack!

272
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:51,359
Quick.

273
00:18:51,359 --> 00:18:52,759
Go die!

274
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:02,680
I will kill...

275
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,079
Attack.

276
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:14,759
I'll kill you.

277
00:19:15,799 --> 00:19:16,440
I...

278
00:19:19,119 --> 00:19:19,680
I...

279
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:40,680
I should have killed you long ago.

280
00:19:49,279 --> 00:19:51,359
Does anyone else still want gold?

281
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,359
No.

282
00:19:53,599 --> 00:19:54,880
We just want to live.

283
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,799
Lad,

284
00:20:01,319 --> 00:20:03,400
Miss Zhang doted on you for nothing.

285
00:20:05,079 --> 00:20:05,880
Seventeen.

286
00:20:11,279 --> 00:20:13,079
Don't leave.

287
00:21:09,559 --> 00:21:10,440
From now on,

288
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,480
call me Father.

289
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:16,359
Can I call you that anytime?

290
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:18,599
Call me that both in public and private.

291
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:22,119
Where are we going?

292
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:24,799
Wusu Sea.

293
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:27,960
To find your 16 other fathers.

294
00:21:31,079 --> 00:21:33,480
Is Wusu Sea as good as Lieyang Well?

295
00:21:34,799 --> 00:21:36,119
Why are you so chatty?

296
00:21:41,039 --> 00:21:42,279
Wusu Sea

297
00:21:42,279 --> 00:21:43,559
is covered in gold everywhere.

298
00:21:44,359 --> 00:21:45,759
It's just like heaven.

299
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,240
Move.

300
00:22:41,599 --> 00:22:42,440
Move.

301
00:22:55,568 --> 00:22:57,310
I shouldn't have given you this spear.

302
00:22:58,160 --> 00:22:58,960
Hou,

303
00:23:01,079 --> 00:23:02,759
how did this happen?

304
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:06,079
The General is dead.

305
00:23:07,960 --> 00:23:09,200
Who said that?

306
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:12,240
The General

307
00:23:12,599 --> 00:23:13,799
won't die.

308
00:23:15,359 --> 00:23:17,200
Neither will you, Deputy.

309
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,559
The General is dead.

310
00:23:22,559 --> 00:23:24,799
Who said that?

311
00:23:29,440 --> 00:23:30,240
Hou,

312
00:23:31,640 --> 00:23:33,160
it seems

313
00:23:34,640 --> 00:23:36,119
I can't see anymore.

314
00:23:42,759 --> 00:23:44,119
Who is it that said

315
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:48,079
the General is dead?

316
00:23:49,359 --> 00:23:50,279
Ha Bingzhong.

317
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:53,480
Deputy,

318
00:23:54,319 --> 00:23:55,359
kill him.

319
00:23:56,119 --> 00:23:57,839
If anyone says

320
00:23:58,279 --> 00:23:59,640
you're dead,

321
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:02,400
I will

322
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:04,680
kill them.

323
00:24:08,119 --> 00:24:09,680
Alright, I'll go kill him.

324
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,359
Bury me

325
00:24:12,960 --> 00:24:14,480
a bit higher.

326
00:24:16,599 --> 00:24:17,720
The higher,

327
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,400
the better.

328
00:24:22,079 --> 00:24:23,359
A place

329
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:25,559
where I can see

330
00:24:26,519 --> 00:24:27,480
Liangzhou.

331
00:24:29,759 --> 00:24:30,480
Alright.

332
00:25:02,119 --> 00:25:03,119
Deputy,

333
00:25:04,279 --> 00:25:06,119
the General is dead?

334
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:09,559
Ready the horses.

335
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:11,200
Back to Liangzhou?

336
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:15,480
We can't go back.

337
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:17,359
Then, where to?

338
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:19,640
To Ganzhou.

339
00:25:26,079 --> 00:25:27,000
To Ganzhou.

340
00:25:28,839 --> 00:25:29,440
Yes, sir.

341
00:25:30,759 --> 00:25:31,599
Ready the horses!

342
00:25:31,808 --> 00:25:32,880
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

343
00:25:52,119 --> 00:25:52,839
I want to see...

344
00:25:52,839 --> 00:25:53,880
Take the horse back.

345
00:25:54,272 --> 00:25:56,656
Riders have always dismounted
before entering the field.

346
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:59,119
Don't you know who I am?

347
00:25:59,319 --> 00:26:00,599
Turn back now,

348
00:26:00,736 --> 00:26:01,880
or I'll put down the horse.

349
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:04,119
I've always ridden straight in.

350
00:26:04,279 --> 00:26:06,559
That was only because
General Ha allowed it back then.

351
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:08,720
Dismount and take it back.

352
00:26:08,832 --> 00:26:10,880
Riding is not permitted
in the martial grounds.

353
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:49,440
I want to see the General.

354
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:51,440
Without General Ha's order,

355
00:26:51,680 --> 00:26:53,480
no one sees the Commander-in-Chief.

356
00:26:57,480 --> 00:26:59,400
Where is Ha Bingzhong?

357
00:27:00,464 --> 00:27:01,550
In the accounting office.

358
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:05,519
Get out of the way.

359
00:27:20,839 --> 00:27:22,000
General Ha.

360
00:27:25,359 --> 00:27:26,759
Ha Bingzhong.

361
00:28:36,119 --> 00:28:37,559
Are you crazy?

362
00:28:56,480 --> 00:28:58,839
I'm here to settle accounts with you.

363
00:29:01,079 --> 00:29:02,640
You found the gold?

364
00:29:03,440 --> 00:29:04,599
Yes.

365
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:06,519
Thirty years ago,

366
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:09,590
it was buried right beneath
the Regional Military Commission Yamen.

367
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:12,200
Who told you that?

368
00:29:12,559 --> 00:29:14,000
Zhang Luyao.

369
00:29:14,799 --> 00:29:17,279
The woman you ordered me
to poison her family

370
00:29:17,599 --> 00:29:19,720
and bring back.

371
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:24,400
It was the General who
ordered you to bring her back.

372
00:29:25,279 --> 00:29:29,200
If the gold were buried under
the Regional Military Commission Yamen,

373
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:31,839
would the General

374
00:29:32,319 --> 00:29:34,559
turn the place upside down to dig it up?

375
00:29:34,559 --> 00:29:36,759
How could you believe
such words from Zhang Luyao?

376
00:29:36,759 --> 00:29:38,880
If it were dug up, how much would I get?

377
00:29:39,079 --> 00:29:41,359
How much would
the General even give you?

378
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:48,960
They said you came back alone.

379
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:51,440
Where are your guys?

380
00:29:55,599 --> 00:29:57,039
They're all dead.

381
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:09,559
Zhang Luyao

382
00:30:10,759 --> 00:30:12,279
killed them?

383
00:30:16,920 --> 00:30:20,599
I shouldn't have let the woman return.

384
00:30:21,559 --> 00:30:23,359
Where is Zhang Luyao now?

385
00:30:25,119 --> 00:30:28,319
She's with the Embroidered
Uniform Guard officer from the Capital.

386
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:31,599
She knows everything.

387
00:30:33,559 --> 00:30:34,839
What does she know?

388
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:37,559
Well...

389
00:30:39,759 --> 00:30:41,839
She knows that the General ordered me

390
00:30:42,079 --> 00:30:44,480
to poison all 27 members of her family!

391
00:30:47,359 --> 00:30:48,960
She knows where the gold is!

392
00:30:48,960 --> 00:30:50,680
She knows everything!

393
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:56,960
Tie Futu,

394
00:30:58,160 --> 00:31:00,400
have you really gone mad?

395
00:31:01,039 --> 00:31:03,759
If I tried to look
for the 300,000 taels of gold again,

396
00:31:03,759 --> 00:31:05,119
then I'd truly be mad.

397
00:31:07,279 --> 00:31:08,240
3,000 taels.

398
00:31:08,759 --> 00:31:09,480
That's not much.

399
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,440
You have gold.

400
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,839
You want 3,000 taels?

401
00:31:16,079 --> 00:31:17,559
Give me the gold,

402
00:31:18,119 --> 00:31:19,680
and we can just drop

403
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,680
this whole matter.

404
00:31:24,680 --> 00:31:25,640
Everything

405
00:31:26,079 --> 00:31:28,319
is up to the General to decide.

406
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:30,680
If there's no gold,

407
00:31:32,319 --> 00:31:35,359
I'll go find the Embroidered
Uniform Guard officer from the Capital.

408
00:31:35,839 --> 00:31:37,559
Why are you looking for him?

409
00:31:37,559 --> 00:31:41,440
To let the people in the Capital
know about the General's decision.

410
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:51,079
Go ahead and find him.

411
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:55,599
Really?

412
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:58,720
Futu, you can do whatever you want.

413
00:32:00,079 --> 00:32:01,839
You've made the decision

414
00:32:02,319 --> 00:32:04,640
for the General on this matter?

415
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:06,920
If the imperial court

416
00:32:07,359 --> 00:32:08,720
finds out that the General...

417
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:11,480
Don't worry about the General.

418
00:32:17,580 --> 00:32:19,860
(Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission)

419
00:32:21,232 --> 00:32:22,920
I'm here to see the Commander-in-Chief.

420
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:23,960
Who goes there?

421
00:32:24,079 --> 00:32:24,839
Dismount!

422
00:32:27,952 --> 00:32:30,160
Embroidered Uniform Guard
on official business.

423
00:32:31,519 --> 00:32:32,559
Embroidered Uniform Guard?

424
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,240
What business?

425
00:32:34,880 --> 00:32:36,000
Just asking

426
00:32:36,359 --> 00:32:38,960
if the Commander-in-Chief
of Gansu is colluding with bandits

427
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,672
and perverting the law
for personal gain.

428
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:52,440
Report!

429
00:32:53,080 --> 00:32:55,120
There's an Embroidered
Uniform Guard officer outside

430
00:32:55,136 --> 00:32:57,050
who wants to investigate
the Commander-in-Chief.

431
00:33:13,359 --> 00:33:15,880
I've risked my life for the General.

432
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:19,799
The General offered 200 taels of gold

433
00:33:20,279 --> 00:33:22,440
for 27 lives of the Zhang family.

434
00:33:23,759 --> 00:33:25,599
I have 20 men with me.

435
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:27,680
That's 100 taels per person.

436
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,400
Isn't that fair?

437
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:34,200
You can forget about
getting another single tael of gold.

438
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:37,599
Consider this matter over.

439
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:39,880
You must leave the Yamen now

440
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:41,119
and never come back.

441
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,519
The General

442
00:33:43,119 --> 00:33:44,960
never knew who you were.

443
00:33:46,039 --> 00:33:49,799
I have never seen you, either.

444
00:33:49,920 --> 00:33:50,799
Now, leave.

445
00:33:56,599 --> 00:33:58,480
I'm going to ask the General myself.

446
00:33:59,559 --> 00:34:00,880
The General is asleep.

447
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:03,319
You say he's sleeping every single time.

448
00:34:04,200 --> 00:34:06,119
The General has
been sleeping all this time.

449
00:34:06,599 --> 00:34:07,839
When he wakes up,

450
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,519
I'll bring him his medicine.

451
00:34:17,119 --> 00:34:18,079
Futu,

452
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:20,480
don't go looking for death.

453
00:34:26,679 --> 00:34:28,239
I won't make a move.

454
00:34:29,320 --> 00:34:31,039
All I need to do is shout.

455
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:34,159
General Ha.

456
00:34:36,119 --> 00:34:36,960
Who is it?

457
00:34:37,136 --> 00:34:39,968
A Capital Embroidered Uniform Guard
officer wants to see the General.

458
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:55,000
Where is he?

459
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:56,760
He's already at the drill grounds.

460
00:34:57,239 --> 00:34:59,280
Tell him to wait. I'll be right over.

461
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:01,199
He says he wants to see
the Commander-in-Chief.

462
00:35:09,119 --> 00:35:10,320
Understood.

463
00:35:10,599 --> 00:35:11,599
Keep an eye on him.

464
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:14,000
Don't let him enter the rear courtyard.

465
00:35:14,880 --> 00:35:15,440
Yes.

466
00:35:32,480 --> 00:35:33,199
Open the gates.

467
00:36:20,400 --> 00:36:21,239
Now,

468
00:36:21,240 --> 00:36:23,120
the Embroidered Uniform Guard
officer is here.

469
00:36:23,559 --> 00:36:26,440
There's no need to search for him, Futu.

470
00:36:29,599 --> 00:36:30,960
When you see the Guard officer,

471
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:32,559
you can tell him

472
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:34,159
everything you know.

473
00:36:34,519 --> 00:36:37,320
Let's see whether he rewards you first

474
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:39,440
or asks my soldiers

475
00:36:40,199 --> 00:36:41,559
to take you down.

476
00:36:42,400 --> 00:36:45,039
If you push me to a dead end,

477
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:47,719
I'll have no choice
but to fight to the death.

478
00:36:47,719 --> 00:36:50,920
What can you gain
from fighting to the death?

479
00:36:50,920 --> 00:36:52,559
At worst, I'll walk away with nothing.

480
00:36:52,559 --> 00:36:54,960
How can you just leave empty-handed?

481
00:36:59,039 --> 00:37:00,280
How about this?

482
00:37:01,239 --> 00:37:02,920
Go to the drill grounds,

483
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:06,599
kill the Embroidered
Uniform Guard officer,

484
00:37:07,519 --> 00:37:09,360
and I'll make the call for the General

485
00:37:09,639 --> 00:37:11,039
to give you

486
00:37:12,400 --> 00:37:13,920
150 taels of gold.

487
00:37:17,079 --> 00:37:18,719
You must be thinking,

488
00:37:19,719 --> 00:37:21,599
after I kill the Guard officer,

489
00:37:23,800 --> 00:37:25,840
how am I supposed to
get out of the Yamen?

490
00:37:30,599 --> 00:37:31,199
Come,

491
00:37:33,039 --> 00:37:33,760
here you go.

492
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:35,719
150 taels of gold.

493
00:37:48,480 --> 00:37:49,920
Futu, think about it.

494
00:37:52,079 --> 00:37:52,880
Carrying

495
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:56,119
all this gold on you,

496
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:59,239
you'll surely be able to run faster.

497
00:38:02,199 --> 00:38:03,519
What are you thinking about now?

498
00:38:05,760 --> 00:38:06,800
Futu,

499
00:38:07,599 --> 00:38:08,760
for half your life,

500
00:38:09,119 --> 00:38:10,559
you've lived on the edge

501
00:38:10,559 --> 00:38:12,199
as a fugitive.

502
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:15,719
Killing one more or one less person,

503
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,920
what difference does it make?

504
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:20,039
As long as you do this,

505
00:38:20,280 --> 00:38:22,679
living in the great desert,

506
00:38:23,639 --> 00:38:24,800
the General

507
00:38:27,079 --> 00:38:29,280
will still remember your favor.

508
00:38:32,760 --> 00:38:34,239
So just like that,

509
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:37,599
I walk out to the drill grounds
and start killing?

510
00:38:38,079 --> 00:38:39,000
Of course not.

511
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:41,039
Of course I'll be going with you.

512
00:38:41,320 --> 00:38:42,840
With my orders,

513
00:38:43,239 --> 00:38:44,559
even moving around

514
00:38:45,239 --> 00:38:47,119
will be much easier.

515
00:39:16,352 --> 00:39:18,128
How long is this announcement
going to take?

516
00:39:18,440 --> 00:39:19,719
The sun is about to set.

517
00:39:37,199 --> 00:39:38,599
The Commander-in-Chief is inside?

518
00:39:40,719 --> 00:39:41,440
Move.

519
00:39:41,808 --> 00:39:44,144
Officer, please don't
make things difficult for us.

520
00:39:47,712 --> 00:39:50,480
I am an Embroidered Uniform Guard
officer sent by the imperial court.

521
00:39:50,816 --> 00:39:52,976
Tell the Commander-in-Chief
to come out and meet me!

522
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:57,079
I could hear

523
00:39:58,079 --> 00:39:59,920
your voice from afar.

524
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:13,320
So that's how it is.

525
00:40:21,519 --> 00:40:22,280
Officer,

526
00:40:23,184 --> 00:40:24,400
how should I address you?

527
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:27,000
Are you the Commander-in-Chief?

528
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:29,239
I'm Ha Bingzhong,

529
00:40:29,599 --> 00:40:30,719
a guerrilla commander.

530
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:32,239
The General

531
00:40:32,719 --> 00:40:33,920
is sleeping inside.

532
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:36,840
This man

533
00:40:37,719 --> 00:40:40,519
colluded with
the General to murder and rob.

534
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:42,199
Are you aware of this?

535
00:40:43,239 --> 00:40:45,000
The General guards the Northwest.

536
00:40:45,559 --> 00:40:47,920
Even if you are from
the Embroidered Uniform Guard,

537
00:40:48,320 --> 00:40:49,840
don't speak nonsense.

538
00:40:50,559 --> 00:40:51,920
I've said what I needed to say.

539
00:40:52,432 --> 00:40:54,670
Tell the Commander-in-Chief
to come out and meet me.

540
00:40:54,960 --> 00:40:57,519
Is the General someone
you can just see whenever you want?

541
00:40:57,519 --> 00:40:59,280
So what if he guards the Northwest?

542
00:40:59,960 --> 00:41:01,480
If he's guilty, he must answer for it.

543
00:41:02,360 --> 00:41:04,679
All land under heaven
belongs to the King.

544
00:41:04,840 --> 00:41:05,880
Yes.

545
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,719
You're right, Officer.

546
00:41:11,480 --> 00:41:12,840
The villain is right here,

547
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:14,560
saving me the trouble of searching.

548
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:15,679
Arrest him.

549
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:17,480
This man

550
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:20,199
originally came to
see the General as well.

551
00:41:20,599 --> 00:41:21,840
Now, he won't be able to.

552
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:24,599
If you want to arrest him,

553
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:26,519
then go ahead.

554
00:41:26,920 --> 00:41:27,840
Arrest him!

555
00:41:28,840 --> 00:41:30,119
Arrest him.

556
00:41:33,760 --> 00:41:35,559
Please, Officer, arrest him.

557
00:41:38,400 --> 00:41:39,760
What is the meaning of this?

558
00:41:42,144 --> 00:41:43,510
What is the meaning of this?

559
00:41:44,039 --> 00:41:45,079
Tie Futu,

560
00:41:45,519 --> 00:41:47,920
the superior officer
ordered your arrest.

561
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:51,039
Surrender at once.

562
00:41:53,519 --> 00:41:54,719
Arrest him.

563
00:41:57,039 --> 00:41:58,159
Did you hear me?

564
00:41:59,599 --> 00:42:01,199
Arrest this jerk!

565
